    "description": "Storehouse, level 1 of 3: shell and fittings (what soldiers build first). Over budget: 432 blocks vs 270 (first build 361 vs 230). Half-timbered barn (plaster in a dark oak frame on a cobblestone course, spruce gable roof) with double oak doors; chests and barrels along the walls and a desk inside; L2 adds the lectern ledger, the hoist beam with a barrel on its chain, the side awning with crates, shelves and door lanterns; L3 hay and crates out front, sign, banners, planters, bushes.",
